WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.469
YASREF will change the salary merit

00:00:04.489 --> 00:00:07.115
and promotion effectiveness update

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.597
from JANUARY to APRIL,

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:12.240
changing only the timing

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:15.586
in alignment with market best practices.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.678
The current cycle runs

00:00:17.698 --> 00:00:19.668
from JANUARY to DECEMBER.

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.488
Here's the new proposed cycle.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.405
The bonus will be paid in MARCH.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.357
In APRIL, merit increases and

00:00:31.377 --> 00:00:34.033
promotion action will be reflected.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.722
During the transition year,

00:00:36.742 --> 00:00:38.646
this transition applies to the

00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:41.040
2027 IMPLEMENTATION YEAR only.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.115
For leave balance, you will receive

00:00:44.135 --> 00:00:46.409
a three-month balance in JANUARY.

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:47.973
And from APRIL 2027,

00:00:47.993 --> 00:00:49.951
a new annual balance begins,

00:00:49.971 --> 00:00:52.399
based on the updated grades.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.127
And the same will applied on the

00:00:56.147 --> 00:00:58.405
vacation allowance where the basic salary

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.182
paid for 3 months and from April

00:01:00.202 --> 00:01:02.541
will reflect the new basic salary.

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:07.451
Comes to the merit, it will cover 15 months,

00:01:07.471 --> 00:01:09.779
while the percentage itself does not change

00:01:09.799 --> 00:01:11.223
— only the months.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:16.125
For further clarification,

00:01:16.145 --> 00:01:18.125
contact HR personnel.
